# The build context holds only what the two images are built from: the Go
# sources and module files. The .git directory, CI definitions and local
# binaries stay out. Add anything else the build reads, such as the files a
# go:embed directive embeds.
*
!go.mod
!go.sum
!**/*.go
# The UI that go:embed compiles in.
!static/index.html
!static/app.js
!static/style.css
!static/battles.html
!static/battles.js
!static/battle.html
!static/battle.js
